### KAPJ Flow — Private Insurance Service REST Client Collection
@baseUrl = http://localhost:8083
@serviceKey = kapj_service_key_for_testing_1234567890_min32

### 1. Health Check Asuransi Swasta
GET {{baseUrl}}/health

### 2. Login Underwriter Asuransi (Bambang Sudarsono)
# @name loginInsurer
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "bambang.sudarsono@sehatsentosa.co.id",
  "password": "SecurityToken@2025!"
}

### Simpan token
@authToken = {{loginInsurer.response.body.data.access_token}}

### 3. Get Profil Underwriter
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/me
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

### 4. [T-204] Dashboard Summary Review Klaim Asuransi Swasta
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/dashboard/summary
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

### 5. [T-204] Daftar Subklaim Sekunder CoB Masuk
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/claims?filter=ALL&page=1&limit=10
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

### 6. [T-205] Detail Klaim SUB-AST-002
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/claims/SUB-AST-002
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

### 7. [T-205] Update Status Review (IN_REVIEW)
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/claims/SUB-AST-002/status
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "status": "IN_REVIEW",
  "notes": "Sedang memeriksa polis Gold Executive dan rincian BHP kateterisasi"
}

### 8. [T-205] Preview Simulasi Potongan Non-Cover & Dampak Ekses Pasien
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/claims/SUB-AST-002/adjudicate-preview
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "non_cover_deduction": 2500000,
  "deduction_reason": "Suplemen hepar & multivitamin injeksi di luar ketentuan polis Gold Exec Bab 4 Psl 8"
}

### 9. [T-205] Keputusan Adjudikasi Asuransi Swasta — SETUJU DENGAN POTONGAN (APPROVED)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/claims/SUB-AST-002/decide
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "decision": "APPROVED",
  "approved_amount": 70000000,
  "non_cover_deduction": 2500000,
  "deduction_reason": "Suplemen hepar & multivitamin injeksi di luar ketentuan polis Gold Exec Bab 4 Psl 8",
  "reviewer_notes": "Biaya stent kateterisasi disetujui sebesar Rp 70.000.000 sesuai batasan manfaat polis Gold Executive.",
  "document_statuses": [
    { "doc_type": "GL_ASURANSI", "status": "VALID" },
    { "doc_type": "RINCIAN_BHP", "status": "CLARIFICATION_NEEDED", "note": "Terdapat selisih kover 1 jenis suplemen/vitamin injeksi" }
  ]
}
